-- Step Erdos454.erdos_454.R1.H1: hypothesis H1 of reduction Erdos454.erdos_454.R1
-- Credit: @sobrien032
-- H1 := ∀ B : ℕ, ∀ᶠ n in Filter.atTop, ∀ i : ℕ, 0 < i → i < n → n ≤ i * (Nat.log 2 n) ^ 2 → 2 * Nat.nth Prime n + B ≤ Nat.nth Prime (n + i) + Nat.nth Prime (n - i)

